 275) — NOT recreation.gov. Reservations have historically opened Dec 1 o
 f the prior year.\n\nDO NOW:\n- Create/verify your reservedenali.com login
 \n- Confirm the exact 2027 opening date + time on the site (Dec 1 is the h
 istorical pattern\, not a guarantee)\n- Have exact dates (Jul 3-10\, 2027)
  and rig specs ready: 40ft Class A + towed truck\n\nRiley Creek fills most
  days in late June/July.
