SUMMARY:📞 Call Fairbanks parks re: extended-stay inventory (Jun 26-Jul 3
  stay)
DESCRIPTION:Fairbanks / North Pole\, AK — stay Jun 26 - Jul 3\, 2027 (pea
 k Midnight Sun season).\n\nThis is a long\, peak-season resupply stop. Fai
 rbanks-area parks fill with both tourists and long-term seasonal/construct
 ion workers holding monthly sites. Standard night-by-night online booking 
 may show NO availability even when sites exist.\n\nDO: Phone the parks dir
 ectly and specifically ask about 'extended stay' or 'monthly' inventory ra
 ther than relying on the online per-night flow.\n\nNo hard release date on
  this one — it's a call-early item\, ~6 months out.
