 rton)
DESCRIPTION:WATCH ITEM — Parks Canada releases the ENTIRE season in one s
 ingle high-demand launch.\n\nThis is the single biggest 'don't miss this m
 oment' item on the whole trip. It affects THREE stops: Waterton\, Banff (T
 unnel Mountain)\, and Jasper (Whistlers) — June 2027.\n\nFor 2026 the la
 unch was Jan 27 at 8am MT. The exact 2027 date is announced by Parks Canad
 a in advance and is NOT yet published.\n\nDO NOW:\n- Check parks.canada.ca
 /voyage-travel/reserve for the announced 2027 launch date\n- Update the 'P
 ARKS CANADA LAUNCH' event on this calendar to the real date/time\n- Create
  your Parks Canada account NOW and verify the login works
