SUMMARY:⚠️ In 5 days: Liard River Hot Springs booking opens (tightest o
 n the trip)
DESCRIPTION:HEADS-UP — Liard River Hot Springs PP\, BC. Stay: arrive Jun 
 16\, 2027.\n\nTHE SINGLE TIGHTEST RESERVATION SQUEEZE ON THE WHOLE ITINERA
 RY.\n\nBC Parks uses a 3-month ROLLING window that releases daily at 7:00a
 m Pacific\, exactly 3 months out. For a Jun 16\, 2027 arrival that is ~Mar
  16\, 2027. Popular dates vanish within minutes.\n\nDO NOW:\n- BC Parks 'D
 iscover Camping' account created and login verified\n- Decide your backup 
 date AND backup campground in advance\n- Note: no hookups here regardless 
 — this is dry camping either way\n\nNOTE: an older version of this plan 
 had a Jun 21 arrival (window Mar 21). The current itinerary arrives Jun 16
 \, so the window opens EARLIER — Mar 16.
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
BEGIN:VALARM
ACTION:DISPLAY
TRIGGER:-PT9H
DESCRIPTION:Booking heads-up — ⚠️ In 5 days: Liard River Hot Springs 
 booking opens (tightest on the trip)
